              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 18.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Parents are not to be put to death for crimes committed by their children, and children are not to be put to death for crimes committed by their parents; people are to be put to death only for crimes they themselves have committed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
